# assets/js/config.js is INTENTIONALLY committed: it holds only PUBLIC values
# (project URL + publishable anon key). No provider secret lives there — the
# Mistral key is a Supabase Secret used only by the "chat-ai" Edge Function.
# Data is protected by Row Level Security (see DB.sql), not by hiding this key.

